"launch in a new disposable, and one will be created for you. Notice that the "
"application was not opened in the disposable template ``default-dvm``: "
"instead, it opens in a :samp:`disp{1234}` qube. This is because applications "
"from a disposable template listed in the :guilabel:`APPS` tab will open in a "
"new disposable."
