"disposables`, choose a number such as ``2`` and click :guilabel:`&OK` to "
"apply and save changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-use-disposables.rst:208
#: 43e9291d7215482794b64c1ee52f7521
msgid ""
"You may deselect :guilabel:`Show internal qubes` to hide them again after "
"making the changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-use-disposables.rst:210
#: 38e5d8b9d94d407d80f61c7f7479c4da
msgid ""
"Qube settings of ``default-mgmt-dvm`` with preloaded disposable setting "
"configured to ``2``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-use-disposables.rst:213
#: 40d9c92b80c24b9b9ba439894df75a2d
msgid ""
"This can also be changed from the command line from the :term:`GUI domain`, "
